# text = This young man , Wilson , has heard of them , you see The person who told me said clearly she neither had , nor would tell Mary's father I don't believe he'd ever heard of it ; he weren't a man to keep still in such a matter , if he had Besides the reason he gave on his death-bed , so to speak , was enough ; ' specially to those who knew him You mean his feelings regarding the treatment of the workmen by the masters ; you think he acted from motives of revenge , in consequence of the part my son had taken in putting down the strike Well , sir it's hard to say : John Barton was not a man to take counsel with people ; nor did he make many words about his doings .
