# text = It's a queer sort of peace we have here , but that night the room was uncommon empty , and I'm not a hard-hearted woman ( I wish I were , I could ha ' made a good thing out of it afore this if I were harder ), so I sent her up -- but she's not here now , I think Was she very bad Ay ! nought but skin and bone , with a cough to tear her in two It is Esther Has it been a dream , then For He will not always chide , neither will He keep
